WEBVTT

00:40:29.675 --> 00:40:34.410
can we build an economy
that raises their interest higher?"

00:40:36.382 --> 00:40:37.532
RD: Those --

00:40:38.191 --> 00:40:41.326
The heroes are those kind of people.

00:40:42.256 --> 00:40:43.786
OK, really.

00:40:44.375 --> 00:40:48.307
But it takes everyone, OK?

00:40:48.331 --> 00:40:53.355
It takes the efficient
allocation of resources for --

00:40:54.601 --> 00:40:57.418
As you probably have seen
behind the scenes,

00:40:57.442 --> 00:41:01.545
we see those who control
a lot of resources